---
import { recognitionPartners } from "../data/recognition";
import RecognitionPartnerLogo from "./RecognitionPartnerLogo.astro";
---

<section class="container-gbe mb-16 max-w-[1120px] max-[560px]:mb-12" aria-labelledby="about-recognition-title">
  <div class="mb-8 grid grid-cols-[0.68fr_1fr] items-end gap-8 max-[760px]:grid-cols-1">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-3 mt-0 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gbe-gold-soft">Recognition and governance</p>
      <h2 id="about-recognition-title" class="gold-text m-0 text-[clamp(28px,3vw,42px)] font-black leading-tight">
        The roles behind the programme
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p class="m-0 text-[clamp(15px,1.15vw,17px)] font-normal leading-[1.72] text-gbe-muted">
      Sri Lankan institutional recognition, business research, and programme administration are different
      responsibilities. DEC's role is recognition of the awards programme, not the delivery or academic
      accreditation of education.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-[900px]:grid-cols-1">
    {recognitionPartners.map((partner, index) => (
      <article class="flex flex-col rounded-[18px] border border-gbe-gold/25 bg-gbe-card p-5 shadow-[var(--c-card-shadow)]">
        <RecognitionPartnerLogo partner={partner} compact maskId={`lbc-about-${index}-mask`} />
        <p class="mb-1 mt-5 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gbe-gold-soft">{partner.eyebrow}</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 mt-0 text-xl font-black leading-tight text-gbe-text">{partner.name}</h3>
        <p class="mb-5 mt-0 flex-1 text-sm font-normal leading-[1.65] text-gbe-muted">{partner.summary}</p>
        <a class="text-sm font-black text-gbe-gold underline decoration-gbe-gold/40 underline-offset-4 hover:text-gbe-gold-bright" href="/recognition">
          Read the full recognition framework
        </a>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>
